Terrain palette-remap FUN_0000_ac70 (extender op-0x18 MAP-LOAD, via 9f70->bc9c): base + correct
the three palette-distance dword tables (module offsets 0xa060/0xa460/0xa860, byte stride 4).  asm acb7
`mov edi,[0xa060+eax*4]; add edi,[0xa460+eax*4]; add edi,[0xa860+eax*4]` (eax = byte-0xf).  Ghidra
base-lost the FIRST table to the bare int 0xa060 (near-NULL host ptr -> SIGSEGV on the first sum) and
emitted the other two as undefined4* + N*4 (pointer arith = N*16 bytes, 4x over-scaled).  All three
rebuilt as byte arithmetic g_mem+fist_ext_base+0xNNNN + N*4.  Flat32-module base-loss + pointer-scaling
class; never exercised before (op-0x18 map-load terrain path).
